 CTRL - Shift Lock Camera (Third Person Camera)\nCapsLock - Shift Lock Shoulder Switch\nShift - Run\nC - Wipe Screen\nClick on player for Player info and rope attach request\n\n🎮 CONSOLE CONTROLS\nR2 - CLIMBING\nL3 - SPRINT\nX - JUMP\nY - Wipe Screen\n\nPlease keep in mind that the game is still in BETA. ","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-78353ac836ac01b5afbfae558fa3f8a9/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e255ee2a252fd75a42b5cc5193ff683c/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d478bc3a179c98bcbcfa2739b6d0cb67/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}